        ],
        "text": "The dissent argued that the Atomic Energy Act does not authorize storage of spent nuclear fuel anywhere."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-98dc84420df0-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The 1980 regulations define spent fuel as including special nuclear material, byproduct material, source material, and other radioactive materials associated with fuel assemblies."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
            "evidence_ids": [
