            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Fasken petitioned to intervene but the Commission denied the petition."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-98dc84420df0-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Commission also denied Fasken's intervention under its regulations implementing \u00a7\u202f2239."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Fasken",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
