            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Fasken argued that the facility posed an unacceptably high risk of environmental contamination."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "98dc84420df006fb94835269e9e88bd2e2a8f206be5762daeffd2f41a431bae6",
